    "summary": "edit: vi fallback hangs agents on non-TTY; no non-interactive path for parent/blocks/owner repair",
    "details_md": "pickEditorCommand (src/cli/commands/edit.ts:37-41) falls back to vi and spawns with stdio inherit and no isInteractive() guard (edit.ts:107) — reproduced: unset EDITOR/VISUAL on non-TTY blocks forever. Worse, edit is the ONLY way to change parent/blocks/discovered_from/owner post-creation (docs/cli-reference.md:196), so the one command agents are steered to for edge repair is the one that hangs them.",
    "acceptance": [
      "non-TTY + no EDITOR fails fast (exit 2) with guidance",
      "a non-interactive alternative exists (edit --stdin or update --parent/--blocks/--owner)"
    ],
